Short   : External MUI UserEditor V1.30 for FAME BBS
Author  : siegel@trsi.de (Sascha Pfalz)
Uploader: siegel@trsi.de (Sascha Pfalz)
Type    : bbs/misc
Kurz    : Externer UserEditor V1.30 fuer FAME BBS
Requires: Kick V3.x, MUI V3.6+, FAME BBS V1.30+, FAME.library V5+,NList.mcc
Version : V1.30
Replaces: bbs/misc/usered12.lha

This Editor allows to edit all Users without using the internal UserEditor.
It is based on MUI V3.6, is localized (german/english) and has all features
the internal UserEditor of FAME has, additional Features like advanced
Searching are also integrated. 

This Program is FreeWare.

In V1.30 the Advanced Search Window was rewritten to use NewList.mcc by
Gilles Masson. This was required during two new Search Options (First login
date/Last login date) which where added for this release. Also some code
optimisations are done.

It requires now Kickstart V3.x to run, lower Versions won't work anymore!
